  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium high heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and cook until tender, about 4 minutes",
    "Add the smoked paprika, salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Add the diced tomato and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally",
    "Add the peeled and deveined shrimp and cook until pink and fully cooked, about 4 minutes",
    "Serve the shrimp and sauce hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired"
